{"agency_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2QSFYTu6lVI", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:34+00:00", "content": "Why  manaakitanga is important for diagnosis\n\nThe way we listen to the consumer and their whānau, and demonstrate manaakitanga (kindness, respect and support) shapes everyone’s understanding of the issues to inform diagnosis.  \n\nCarlton Irving, Director Māori Health and Consumer at Te Tāhū Hauora Health Quality & Safety Commission, discusses the importance of manaakitanga in diagnosis.\n\nFor more information on Aotearoa Patient Safety Day, visit hqsc.govt.nz/AotearoaPatientSafetyDay2024", "content_hash": "9939a960049385d49d62e2ae68957f92767d4970b89c4675654334b388ff4ac9", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission-youtube-a1b00f74", "video_id": "2QSFYTu6lVI"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2024-11-11T02:24:25+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2024-11\\905813e0c583f2aeb3f658d0.json", "record_id": "youtube:905813e0c583f2aeb3f658d0", "source_account": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q"}
{"agency_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oWV2HxUp7e4", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:34+00:00", "content": "How can manaakitanga help us navigate uncertainty in the diagnostic process?\n\nThe way we listen to the consumer and their whānau, and demonstrate manaakitanga (kindness, respect and support) shapes everyone’s understanding of the issues to inform diagnosis.  As clinicians we want to encourage questions to help make decisions together, and for the consumers and their whānau to leave feeling heard and well informed.  \n\nListen to Carlton Irving, Director Māori Health and Consumer at Te Tāhū Hauora Health Quality & Safety Commission discuss this further.\n\nFind out more about Aotearoa Patient Safety Day: hqsc.govt.nz/AotearoaPatientSafetyDay2024", "content_hash": "c0a6869c25b46d737476b63e0ceff206f94e10af1a17a2a2c60a0924e5dfe05a", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission-youtube-a1b00f74", "video_id": "oWV2HxUp7e4"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2024-11-11T02:21:22+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2024-11\\0a35e03d59d19a3c219cf3a9.json", "record_id": "youtube:0a35e03d59d19a3c219cf3a9", "source_account": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q"}
{"agency_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2zxSoilpaFM", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:48:34+00:00", "content": "Improving diagnosis through listening and manaakitanga\n\nAotearoa Patient Safety Day is a commitment to consumers and healthcare workers that our health services strive to provide the best and safest care possible, every time.  \n\nThe way we listen to the consumer and their whānau, and demonstrate manaakitanga (kindness, respect and support) shapes everyone’s understanding of the issues to inform diagnosis. \n\nListen to Carlton Irving, Director Māori Health and Consumer at Te Tāhū Hauora Health Quality & Safety Commission talk about the importance of listening and manaakitanga to inform diagnosis.\n\nFor more information visit: www.hqsc.govt.nz/AotearoaPatientSafetyDay2024", "content_hash": "4afb920c038e7860ff279f276a7573ac1412c616099348f63254d00785b6df28", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_id": "health-quality-and-safety-commission-youtube-a1b00f74", "video_id": "2zxSoilpaFM"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2024-11-11T02:16:25+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2024-11\\d2a19cdd34a5590689e5a8a5.json", "record_id": "youtube:d2a19cdd34a5590689e5a8a5", "source_account": "UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5yFtbreIu20QxZMb4v7L7Q"}
{"agency_id": "oranga-tamariki", "canonical_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oGQy_RvZ8CE", "captured_at": "2026-06-25T07:50:04+00:00", "content": "Our national apology\n\nOn 12 November 2024 the Government delivered a national apology to survivors of abuse in state care.\n\nOranga Tamariki Chief Executive, Andrew Bridgman, joined leaders of Health, Education, Police, Crown Law, Public Service Commission and the Ministry of Social Development to apologise for the failings of the public service.\n\nTo every survivor, and every person who did not survive.\n\nTo the children who we failed.\n\nTo the adults those children have now become.\n\nWe are sorry.", "content_hash": "44164b06ccbe9ea2720c03ff315c21262557f624e8689b362d7b8408b382d248", "cross_source_ids": {"channel_id": "UCWpNNGDSur1P7ytjZEfFfKA", "feed_url": "https://www.youtube.com/feeds/videos.xml?channel_id=UCWpNNGDSur1P7ytjZEfFfKA", "source_id": "oranga-tamariki-youtube-258eda72", "video_id": "oGQy_RvZ8CE"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_youtube_channel_rss", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2024-11-11T22:45:08+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\youtube\\2024-11\\073cf5b828506c5bd548c38b.json", "record_id": "youtube:073cf5b828506c5bd548c38b", "source_account": "YouTube \n    \n\n    \n         , opens in a new window", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "youtube", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWpNNGDSur1P7ytjZEfFfKA"}
